---
// Minimal homepage hero for VitalGreenz
---

<section class="flex min-h-[70vh] items-center justify-center bg-emerald-50 px-6">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
		<p class="mb-4 text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-emerald-700">
			VitalGreenz
		</p>
		<h1 class="mb-6 text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-emerald-950 sm:text-5xl">
			Premium teas, brewed for everyday wellness
		</h1>
		<p class="mb-8 text-lg text-emerald-800/80">
			Thoughtfully sourced blends delivered fresh to your door.
		</p>
		<a
			href="/products"
			class="inline-block rounded-full bg-emerald-700 px-8 py-3 text-sm font-semibold text-white transition hover:bg-emerald-800"
		>
			Shop the collection
		</a>
	</div>
</section>
